of course.

> I would, and its not horribly unbalancing, says Mr. Hasn't
> Considered the Issues Carefully Enough.

It removes a lot of ring/amulet ID difficulties. Note that unlimited
enlightenment is an invocation effect of a Quest Artifact (the Eyes of
the Overworld); it's debatable whether the hassle of finding a wand of
enlightenment and being in a position to eat it is comparable to the
hassle of obtaining a Quest Artifact and putting up with its
invocation timeout.

